{%- comment -%} Renders one card per variant. `variant` is passed in from the PLP;
  falls back to the first available variant if rendered without one. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign variant = variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign winery = product.metafields.custom.vendor.value.name -%}
{%- assign winery_link = product.metafields.custom.vendor.value.vendor_collection.value.url -%}
{%- assign vintage = variant.metafields.custom.vintage.value | default: variant.metafields.custom.vintage -%}
{%- comment -%} Samme kilde som PDP-brødkrummen, se sections/jkl-pdp.liquid {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign region = product.metafields.custom.region.value.h1 | default: product.metafields.custom.region.value.name -%}

{%- comment -%} Uden prisdata for det aktive land vises hverken pris eller købsknap. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture price_available %}{% render 'jkl-price-available', variant: variant %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- assign price_available = price_available | strip -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Reviews — samme kilde og samme matchning som PDP'en, se sections/jkl-pdp.liquid:
  et where-filter mod produktets egen metafelt-drop matcher aldrig, og med en tom
  værdi returnerer `where` samtlige reviews. Derfor findes først ét review for denne
  WSI, og dets egen drop bruges så som sammenligningsværdi.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign reviews_all = shop.metaobjects.reviews.values
  assign card_wsi_handle = product.metafields.custom.wsi.value.system.handle
  assign review_seed = blank
  if card_wsi_handle != blank
    for review in reviews_all
      if review.wsi_object.value.system.handle == card_wsi_handle
        assign review_seed = review
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  if review_seed == blank
    assign matching_reviews = '' | split: ','
  else
    assign matching_reviews = reviews_all | where: 'wsi_object', review_seed.wsi_object
  endif
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  Kortet viser de to højeste bedømmelser. Scoren normaliseres til en 100-skala først,
  så stjerne- og 20-punktsanmeldelser kan sammenlignes med point-anmeldelser.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign top_review = blank -%}
{%- assign top_review_score = 0 -%}
{%- assign second_review = blank -%}
{%- assign second_review_score = 0 -%}
{%- for review in matching_reviews -%}
  {%- assign review_score = review.reviewscore.value | default: review.reviewscore | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign review_type = review.reviewtype.value | default: review.reviewtype | default: 'Points (value 0 to 100)' -%}
  {%- assign review_type_handle = review_type | handleize -%}
  {%- if review_type_handle contains 'star' -%}
    {%- assign normalized_review_score = review_score | times: 100 | divided_by: 6 -%}
  {%- elsif review_type_handle contains '20' -%}
    {%- assign normalized_review_score = review_score | times: 5 -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign normalized_review_score = review_score -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if top_review == blank or normalized_review_score > top_review_score -%}
    {%- assign second_review = top_review -%}
    {%- assign second_review_score = top_review_score -%}
    {%- assign top_review = review -%}
    {%- assign top_review_score = normalized_review_score -%}
  {%- elsif second_review == blank or normalized_review_score > second_review_score -%}
    {%- assign second_review = review -%}
    {%- assign second_review_score = normalized_review_score -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
<article
  class="product-card"
  data-wishlist-card
  data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
  data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
>
  {%- if variant.metafields.custom.show_member_price.value -%}
    <div class="member-banner-bar"></div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <a
    href="#"
    class="wishlist-icon"
    aria-label="Wishlist"
    aria-pressed="false"
    role="button"
    data-wishlist-toggle
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
  >
    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M12 21s-7-4.5-7-10a4 4 0 017-2.6A4 4 0 0119 11c0 5.5-7 10-7 10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"></path>
    </svg>
  </a>
  {%- assign card_image = variant.image | default: product.featured_image -%}
  <a href="{{ product.url }}?variant={{ variant.id }}" class="image-container">
    <div class="bottle-shadow"></div>
    {%- if card_image != blank -%}
      <img class="product-image" src="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="{{ card_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">
    {%- else -%}
      <img class="product-image product-image--placeholder" src="{{ 'no-pic.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">
    {%- endif -%}
  </a>
  {%- if collection_card -%}
    {%- assign sticker_label = variant.metafields.custom.product_sticker.value | default: variant.metafields.custom.sticker.value | default: product.metafields.custom.product_sticker.value | default: product.metafields.custom.sticker.value | default: 'Best seller' -%}
    {%- assign sticker_type = variant.metafields.custom.product_sticker_type.value | default: variant.metafields.custom.sticker_type.value | default: product.metafields.custom.product_sticker_type.value | default: product.metafields.custom.sticker_type.value | default: sticker_label -%}
    {%- assign sticker_type_handle = sticker_type | handleize -%}
    {%- if sticker_type_handle == 'best-seller' or sticker_type_handle == 'bestseller' -%}
      {% render 'jkl-product-sticker-best-seller' %}
    {%- else -%}
      {% render 'jkl-product-sticker-other', label: sticker_label %}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="card-meta"><div class="badges">
    {%- comment -%}
      Samme metafelter som styrer .member-banner nedenfor og pdp-price.liquid.
      Modsat prisblokken, hvor medlemspris slår tilbud, kan begge badges vises her.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if variant.metafields.custom.show_member_price.value -%}
      <span class="badge member">{{ 'jkl.badge_member_price' | t }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if variant.metafields.custom.on_sale_for_all.value -%}
      <span class="badge on-sale">{{ 'content.product_badge_sale' | t }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      top_review_score er normaliseret til en 100-skala ovenfor, så stjerne- og
      20-punktsanmeldelser tæller med på lige fod med point-anmeldelser.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if top_review_score >= 94 -%}
      <span class="badge">{{ 'jkl.badge_top_rated' | t }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if region != blank -%}
      <span class="badge">{{ region }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="ratings">
    {% render 'jkl-product-rating', review: top_review, product: product, variant: variant %}
    {%- comment -%}
      Uden vagt ville snippet'en falde tilbage på produktets egne rating-metafelter
      og gentage den første bedømmelse, når vinen kun har én anmeldelse.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if second_review != blank -%}
      {% render 'jkl-product-rating', review: second_review %}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  </div>
  {%- if variant.metafields.custom.show_member_price.value -%}
    <div class="member-banner">Member price — Member price — Member price — Member price — Member price</div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="card-divider"></div>
  <div class="card-bottom">
    <div class="product-info">
      <div class="winery">
        {%- if winery_link != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ winery_link }}">{{ winery | default: product.vendor }}</a>
        {%- else -%}
          {{ winery | default: product.vendor }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <a href="{{ product.url }}?variant={{ variant.id }}" class="wine-name-link"><p class="wine-name">{{ variant.option1 }} {{ product.title }}</p></a>
      {%- assign collection_text = product.metafields.custom.collection_text | default: variant.metafields.custom.collection_text -%}
      {%- comment -%} Metafeltet kan indeholde rich text. Et <p> inde i <p> brækker
        kortets layout, så alle tags fjernes. Afsnit og <br> bliver til mellemrum,
        så ord ikke klæber sammen når tags forsvinder. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign collection_text = collection_text | replace: '</p>', ' ' | replace: '<br>', ' ' | replace: '<br/>', ' ' | replace: '<br />', ' ' | strip_html | strip_newlines | strip -%}
      {%- if collection_text != blank -%}
        <p class="wine-description">{{ collection_text }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="price-section">
      {%- comment -%} Same price block as the PDP, always the full (non-simple)
        version. scope: 'plp' renders clean plp-* classes (no pdp traces). {%- endcomment -%}
      {% render 'pdp-price', product: product, variant: variant, scope: 'plp', force_full: true %}
      {%- comment -%} Uden prisdata for det aktive land udelades hele købsblokken. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if price_available != blank -%}
        <div class="actions">

          <div class="quantity-selector"><span>-</span><span>6</span><span>+</span></div>
          {%- form 'product', product, id: 'jkl-product-form-{{ variant.id }}' -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="{% render 'qty-bulk-size', variant: variant %}" min="1" class="pdp-qty-value">
            <button type="submit" class="btn-add-to-basket"{% unless product.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>
              {%- if product.available -%}{{ 'actions.add_to_cart' | t }} {%- else -%}{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}{%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endform -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
